                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "27daad4a-cac1-3513-aff9-4039db581748",
                        "entry_id": "0c866de6-42ef-3bbc-a4ae-6ac8d6b70630",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To inform on; to betray."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canada",
                            "US",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e74f4c00-30ce-46ab-9169-c52cd85cc78a",
                                "sense_id": "27daad4a-cac1-3513-aff9-4039db581748",
                                "text": "It led to some rather incredible and colourful claims in the submission by the union that the employers had ratfinked on previous agreements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d418b581-b602-469e-b4a6-93db5f1daa5a",
                                "sense_id": "27daad4a-cac1-3513-aff9-4039db581748",
                                "text": "The dumb bastard says he never rat-finks on a woman. They're too precious, he tells me. And he should know. He has had many of them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b4c01ca-bdfe-4ac3-81c3-c9eb1a6756e6",
                                "sense_id": "27daad4a-cac1-3513-aff9-4039db581748",
                                "text": "There's a breed of people in every office who breed problems around them—ratfinking about your long lunch breaks, revealing confidential salary information, blaming everyone for every error."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05d36583-1d0b-4a78-ae15-1a5d23fd678c",
                                "sense_id": "27daad4a-cac1-3513-aff9-4039db581748",
                                "text": "On Feb. 11, McLeod officials marched into the FCC [Federal Communications Commission] to relate this story, just as Netscape rat-finked on Microsoft to the Department of Justice. FCC officials demanded that Qwest tell them what the heck was going on."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddd8e1dc-d70c-4232-a5c4-4642b777e3e0",
                                "sense_id": "27daad4a-cac1-3513-aff9-4039db581748",
                                "text": "Take a three-inch notepad (similar to a Post-It note), and print a large, brightly colored letter on it. […] \"T\" stands for \"Tattle Tale.\" Punishment for rat-finking on the other child."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93628059-5339-4d4d-9039-0af58ab12869",
                                "sense_id": "27daad4a-cac1-3513-aff9-4039db581748",
                                "text": "I shoved Sahlil off of me. He fell backward on my bed. \"What? Who the hell rat finked on me?\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
